    <div>
      <p begin="00:02.120" end="00:04.260" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(I did it for love)</p>
      <p begin="00:04.260" end="00:07.870" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Ride the highway, rock the bus (rock it, rock it)</p>
      <p begin="00:07.870" end="00:11.250" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Why my house look like Army Plus? (Ready up, ready up)</p>
      <p begin="00:11.250" end="00:17.160" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Walk in the strip, she gon' make it bust (bust it, whoo, bust it)</p>
      <p begin="00:17.160" end="00:18.800" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I do damage (bust it)</p>
      <p begin="00:18.800" end="00:20.670" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">You niggas can't stand it (bust it)</p>
