      <p begin="00:22.330" end="00:24.100" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Like it's Marilyn Manson (bust it)</p>
      <p begin="00:24.100" end="00:26.070" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Got the cash, advance it (bust it)</p>
