      <p begin="00:31.500" end="00:33.150" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">She pop Perc' like a Plan B (bust it)</p>
      <p begin="00:33.150" end="00:35.110" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Oh, she lit like a candle (candle)</p>
      <p begin="00:35.110" end="00:37.070" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Boot it up in the car seat (car seat)</p>
      <p begin="00:37.070" end="00:39.110" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Hold a nigga for ransom (ransom)</p>
      <p begin="00:39.110" end="00:40.960" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Want her back? Better call me (bust it)</p>
      <p begin="00:40.960" end="00:42.460" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">It's whatever, I'm geeked (I'm geeked)</p>
      <p begin="00:42.380" end="00:43.990" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">'Bout to punch at the party (whoo)</p>
      <p begin="00:43.990" end="00:45.870" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">You niggas ain't fly, this shit lookin' dummy (yeah)</p>
      <p begin="00:45.870" end="00:47.400" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I popped to get fried, I look like a mummy (bust it)</p>
      <p begin="00:47.400" end="00:49.130" ttm:agent="v1">I'm gettin' this cash, it's Monday to Sunday</p>
      <p begin="00:49.130" end="00:51.210" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I guess you won't talk if it ain't 'bout the money (bust it)</p>
      <p begin="00:51.210" end="00:53.010" ttm:agent="v1">My boys in the trap, and it jump like a bunny</p>
