      <p begin="00:54.680" end="00:56.500" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I fuck from the side and I keep that bitch cummin' (whoa)</p>
      <p begin="00:56.500" end="00:58.450" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">If I gotta reach up, I'ma keep that bitch dumpin' (whoa)</p>
      <p begin="00:58.450" end="01:00.350" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Way I slide in that coupe, boy, I keep that bitch hummin' (yeah)</p>
      <p begin="01:00.350" end="01:02.350" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">We done went and rocked that bitch all the way to the summer (whoo)</p>
      <p begin="01:02.350" end="01:03.950" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Get deep in the pot, get deep like a plumber (deep)</p>
      <p begin="01:03.950" end="01:06.080" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Why would I keep her? I never will love her (no)</p>
      <p begin="01:06.080" end="01:07.620" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I just went fucked her and gave to my brother (yeah)</p>
      <p begin="01:07.620" end="01:09.720" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Eat her for dinner or eat her for supper (yeah)</p>
      <p begin="01:09.720" end="01:11.730" ttm:agent="v1">Why would you keep her, lil' nigga? You sucker</p>
      <p begin="01:11.730" end="01:16.080" ttm:agent="v1">Why would you keep her, lil' nigga? You suck</p>
