      <p begin="01:24.620" end="01:30.630" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Walk in the strip, she gon' make it bust (bust it, bust it)</p>
      <p begin="01:30.630" end="01:32.580" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I do damage (bust it)</p>
