      <p begin="01:37.790" end="01:39.330" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Got the cash, advance it (bust it)</p>
      <p begin="01:39.330" end="01:40.970" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Get the Sprite and enhance it (bust it)</p>
      <p begin="01:40.970" end="01:42.660" ttm:agent="v1">Pull the Wock' out the pantry</p>
      <p begin="01:42.660" end="01:44.650" ttm:agent="v1">You niggas ain't fly, this shit lookin' dummy</p>
      <p begin="01:44.650" end="01:46.530" ttm:agent="v1">I popped to get fried, I look like a mummy</p>
      <p begin="01:46.530" end="01:48.150" ttm:agent="v1">I'm gettin' this cash, it's Monday to Sunday</p>
      <p begin="01:48.150" end="01:50.040" ttm:agent="v1">I guess you won't talk if it ain't 'bout the money</p>
